Undefined reference stays literal[^missing].

Truncated reference stays literal [^truncated.

[^before]: This definition appears before its reference.

Definition before reference[^before].

Forward reference[^Forward] and repeated reference[^FORWARD].

> Nested reference[^nested].

[^forward]: Forward definition with **formatting**.

[^nested]: Nested definition.
